414	+  `fn push_tool_uses(messages: &mut Vec<Value>, pending_tool_use: &mut Vec<Value>, blocks: Vec<Value>)`.
415	+  It extends the content array of `messages.last_mut()` when that message has `role == "assistant"`. Otherwise it extends `pending_tool_use`.
416	+- Produces (test helper, next to `tu`/`tr`):
